# Event-driven commerce – API Gateway (localhost:3000)

### Create Order (rode primeiro; o orderId é usado automaticamente abaixo)
# @name createOrder
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "prod-001", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "prod-002", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Get Order by ID (usa orderId da resposta do Create Order)
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.orderId}}

### Search Orders (sem filtro)
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/search

### Search Orders by status CONFIRMED
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/search?status=CONFIRMED

### Search Orders by status PENDING
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/search?status=PENDING

### Search Orders by query (usa orderId da resposta do Create Order)
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/search?q={{createOrder.response.body.orderId}}
